[00:34.000]What was here before the rocks and forests
{"在岩石与森林出现之前这里曾是什么"}
[00:40.000]I don't care
{"我不在乎"}
[00:42.000]It's hard enough to deal with human forces
{"光是应对人类的力量就已足够艰难"}
[00:49.000]I was never happy for you
{"我从未为你感到高兴"}
[00:54.000]You were weighing me down
{"你曾是我的负担"}
[00:57.000]You never trusted me
{"你从未信任过我"}
[01:03.000]But I'm alright now
{"但现在的我已释然"}
[01:06.000]Tell me what you wanted
{"告诉我你曾渴望什么"}
[01:13.000]I've been calling back to those before us
{"我一直在呼唤那些先于我们的存在"}
[01:19.000]But they didn't hear
{"但他们没有听见"}
[01:21.000]I've been losing friends and enemies
{"我逐渐失去朋友与敌人"}
[01:25.000]It's even now
{"如今两相抵消"}
[01:29.000]I looked underneath the dirt and bodies
{"我翻检泥土与尸骸之下"}
[01:35.000]And there's nothing there
{"却空无一物"}
[01:37.000]I can hear the voices echoing
{"能听见回声般的絮语"}
[01:42.000]It's in my head
{"那只是脑海中的幻听"}
[01:45.000]Did you find a higher purpose
{"你可曾寻得更高使命"}
[01:53.000]It never worked for me
{"这对我从未奏效"}
[01:57.000]I'm just waiting around
{"我只是在茫然等待"}
[02:01.000]Tell me where we're going
{"告诉我我们将去往何方"}
